We need to construct a data model for a simple testing application.
There are two kinds of users, student and teacher.
A teacher can create a test for a subject (i.e. mathematics). The subjects are stored in a separate table.
A test has a specific time interval in which it is available.
A test contains a series of questions.
The questions can be of three types: single choice, multiple choice and free answer (a small essay)
Each single choice question has answers, which can be marked correct or incorrect
Each multiple choice question has answers, which can be marked correct or incorrect
A student can take the test and provide a test submission
A test submission contains answers to the questions
